      <h1>Rule your classroom with <em>clear pedagogy</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Pedagogy Crown turns the big ideas of teaching into practical tools. Build questions at every level of thinking, design fair rubrics in seconds and explore the theories behind how people learn.</p>
